      <h1>Commercial Business Loan Calculator (<%= currentYear %>) &mdash; Compare SBA vs. Bank Financing</h1>
      <div class="hero-meta">
        <span><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 14 14"/></svg> Side-by-Side Dual Engine</span>
        <span><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg> 2026 Commercial Bank Spreads</span>
        <span><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/></svg> Updated September <%= currentYear %></span>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-desc">
        Compare two commercial business loan scenarios side-by-side. Calculate exact monthly debt service payments, total interest obligations, monthly cash flow differences, and cumulative financing savings across <strong>SBA 7(a)</strong>, <strong>conventional bank term loans</strong>, <strong>equipment leases</strong>, and <strong>lines of credit</strong>.
      </p>
