    <!-- Section 1: How to Compare -->
    <section class="content-section" id="how-to-use">
      <h2>How to Use This Business Loan Calculator</h2>
      <ol style="padding-left:1.4rem; line-height:1.8;">
        <li><strong>Enter your required loan amount</strong>: Type your total net borrowing requirement. Both scenarios evaluate the exact same principal balance for a true apples-to-apples comparison.</li>
        <li><strong>Set up Scenario A (e.g. SBA 7a or Long-Term Loan)</strong>: Input your quoted interest rate and term (e.g. 11.25% APR for 10 years).</li>
        <li><strong>Set up Scenario B (e.g. Conventional Bank or Short-Term Debt)</strong>: Input the alternative rate and term (e.g. 8.50% APR for 5 years).</li>
        <li><strong>Evaluate the Cash Flow vs. Total Cost Trade-Off</strong>: Review the monthly debt service difference to ensure your operating cash flow supports the payment, and check the lifetime interest savings.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

